WEBVTT

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:01.790
Here's Grok on your phone.

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:05.190
Open the App Store or Google Play and search for Grok.

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:07.080
Check it's the official Grok app,

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.490
with the same icon you see on this screen,

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.410
then tap Get or Install.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.440
It's free.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.660
Open it and sign in with your email,

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:18.000
Google, or your X account, or make a free account.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.370
You type your own password, on Grok's screen only.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:26.930
When you see the chat box, come back to our page and tap 'Copy prompt and open Grok'.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:29.010
Paste it into the chat and send.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:30.656
Your trainer takes it from there.

